{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号标题，首先被红色第一行和亮黄色第二行吸引；尤其第二行亮度高、字号大，形成明确的视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人不再掩饰自己对某人的喜欢，开始坦然表现心意。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"热切、主动、顾不上害臊，带有强烈的心动感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"期待似乎终于得到满足，但事情还没有结束；像从梦境中突然回到现实的心理落差。右侧目录呈现了此前经历的情感阶段。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"下方辅助文案较长，包含梦境感、回到现实、期待得到满足和事情尚未结束等多层信息，需要细读才能完整理解。\",\n    \"右上角多条小字连续排列，快速扫视难以辨认各阶段的具体内容。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 4\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "345e6083-e6a3-4c1b-adec-c6c113d8f9dd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T020618429569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:06:59.258677+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4e2bd9ea161efa86602cb71f08d7faa4ea1d9389bb2c28217bd128408e65568", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa